        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system shows the search box, the [Tours | Places] tabs, the city picker (&quot;Featured destinations&quot; list), the [List | Map] toggle and the &quot;Continue listening&quot; (recently opened tours), &quot;Near you&quot; and &quot;Popular&quot; sections." vertex="1">
