        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The system (Tour) returns only tours in the Public status with the number of places, duration and rating; results are paginated with a numbered pager. E1, E2." vertex="1">
